<title>USA: Identix says it won ruling in patent case.</title>
<headline>Identix says it won ruling in patent case.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Identix Inc said a U.S. federal court in California has ruled that its TouchPrint-600 fingerprint-imaging machine does not infringe on a patent held by Digital Biometrics Inc.</p>
<p>The ruling disposes of Digital Biometrics case against Identix, the company said in a statement.</p>
